manifest-revision 4 (kzs-sites 4)
plan-id b67f3299474a135e
selection observation-set: every row of the relations (method document 3.1, the revised rule: no label and no proof of a row removes it)
priority method-priority: method priority port revision 1 (2026-11-16): label, order class, reach mark and disposition of the method document's S1 rule over the row text; tier 1 = disposition D07 (label R or J, counterpart, order class RELOC), tier 2 = the other rows of order class RELOC, tier 3 = the rest; within a tier the order of the relations text
classes rows 4 tier1 1 tier2 2 tier3 1
budget value=all reason="the test budget" disclosure="none given" planned=4 truncation=0 rows cut (row lines with state cut) unresolved="none" sensitivity="not measured"
control control selection rule revision 1 (2026-11-16): (a) path A rows with a probe-create handling line, (b) path A rows with a creator site (creator lines and not-a-pair lines of key constants), (a) then (b) in the order of the relations text; planned apart from the tier order (docs/plan_manifest.md section 7)
control-budget value=all reason="the test control budget" rows=3 (a 1, b 2) planned=3 cut=0 complete=yes unresolved="whether the control rows fit the record pool (no event volume measured)" sensitivity="not measured"
requests sha256=<sha256> file=plan.req rows=3 requests=13 planned=10
namespace-data <data>/planv4_fixture/framework_namespaces_fixture-plan.txt entries=1
bound string KZ_RT_STR_MAX=64 source=runtime/include/kz_rt.h:82 reason="the runtime's copy bound; a key text is bounded by the program's own constant length check where the facts show one" truncation="the runtime flags a cut string per value"
bound string-extent source=ARG_TYPES reason="a key argument that is a character array read at a point that dominates the call is copied at the call within min(its extent, KZ_RT_STR_MAX)"
